        <item>
            <title>0.2.7</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 13:03:24 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://nfarina.github.io/brushy</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/nfarina/brushy/releases/tag/v0.2.7</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- Elliptical Marquee: choose rectangle or ellipse in the Marquee's options bar, press ⇧M, or right-click the Marquee button.
- Polygonal Lasso: choose it in the Lasso's options bar, press ⇧L, or right-click the Lasso button. Click to place points (⇧ for 45°), then click the first point, double-click or press Return to close. ⌫ removes the last point and Esc cancels.
- Tools show their name and shortcuts after a moment's hover, instead of the slow system tooltip.
- Clicking a layer's or group's name now selects it immediately, instead of after a short delay.
]]></description>
